      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2023-june/q2",
      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\"><li>Write down the Maclaurin series of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm e^x\"></span>, in ascending power of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, up to and including the term in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Hence, without differentiating, determine the Maclaurin series of<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm e^{\\left(\\mathrm e^x-1\\right)}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, up to and including the term in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3\"></span>, giving each coefficient in simplest form.</p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></li></ol>",
