      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2023-june/q3",
      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;5\\\\6&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant.</p><p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^2+11\\mathbf M=a\\mathbf I\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is a constant and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf I\"></span> is the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\"></span> identity matrix,</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span></li><li>show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-9\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Determine the equations of the invariant lines of the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li><li>State which, if any, of the lines identified in (b) consist of fixed points, giving a reason for your answer. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
