      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2023-june/q6",
      "question": "<p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm e^{2x}\\sinh x\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>prove by induction that for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\"></span></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\mathrm d^ny}{\\mathrm dx^n}=\\mathrm e^{2x}\\left(\\frac{3^n+1}{2}\\sinh x+\\frac{3^n-1}{2}\\cosh x\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p>",
